<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13322"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Weeza<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Weeza<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, May 02, 2005 - 1:02 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I KNOW this is really off topic, but a friend is missing her kids... could be taken anywhere, but most likely PA, WV, IL, MI <BR> <BR>Thanks! Here&#39;s pics: <BR> <BR><a href="http://ourmissingkids.homestead.com/" target=_top>http://ourmissingkids.homestead.com/</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
