<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13323"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, May 02, 2005 - 1:40 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ok Weeza, I am 15 mins from WV and very close to PA So tell me what I am looking for.   Sheila<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13323-->
<!--Post: 13325--><!--Time: 1115028134-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13325"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Weeza<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Weeza<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, May 02, 2005 - 3:02 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><a href="http://ourmissingkids.homestead.com/index.html" target=_top>http://ourmissingkids.homestead.com/index.html</a> <BR> <BR>I finished it finally...you are looking for these kids. In the photo album up top is a pic of the non-custodial mom, and their dad misses these kids very much. <BR>There is a police file on this... <BR>There isn&#39;t much info except that they could be in any one of 5 states...Most likely in PA, WV, IL, MI. No vehicle description yet, I&#39;ll ask tomorrow.  <BR>I just wanted to get what info I could out there. <BR>The pic at the top in the album, and one at the bottom of the page are of the mother in this case who does not have custody. I&#39;ll know more tomorrow.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13325-->
<!--Post: 13347--><!--Time: 1115126289-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13347"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 03, 2005 - 6:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ok, I have talked to a few of the police officers here, where I live about posting their pictures. Sorry yes I see we are looking for the kids. I just didn&#39;t know who took them of what they were driving. But as soon as you know. Please post. If nothing else I could at least make sure our State Police are paying attention in my area. We have a new law here that keeps single parents from enrolling their children in school. With out court papers showing custody. So I doubt we would catch them through the public system, even for kindergarden. We have a few of our own children recently missing. So our police are looking. I would like to get them to pay attention to others that may be driving thru the area of WV Ohio Pa  Just trying to help if I can. thanks Sheila<!--/Text--></td></tr>
